		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_RESOURCE_ROMANSTATUE">
			<Text>Roman statues</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CIV5_RESOURCE_ROMANSTATUE_TEXT">
			<Text>Classical sculpture refers loosely to the forms of sculpture from Ancient Greece and Ancient Rome, as well as the Hellenized and Romanized civilizations under their rule or influence from about 500 BC to around 200 AD. Classical sculptures have been popular since the Renaissance.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_BUILDING_FORUM">
